msgid ""
"ROS 2 parameters for public controllers in "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) at"
" commit [`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48). How"
" to load and inspect them: [Configure ROS 2 controller "
