#: e528c328363f4991b0e011ae69d02658
msgid ""
"Names, types, and defaults come from the linked README or from "
"`auto_declare` / `declare_parameter` at this pin. Runtime vs startup "
"follows the [how-to "
"rule](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#startup-vs-"
"runtime-what-is-verified). Rows marked **未核实** mean "
"**未核实（启动时加载；运行时是否可改未在源码中确认）**."
msgstr ""
"名称、类型与默认值来自链接的 README，或本 pin 的 `auto_declare` / `declare_parameter`。运行时 vs 启动时遵循[操作指南中的规则](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#startup-vs-runtime-what-is-verified)。标为**未核实**表示**未核实（启动时加载；运行时是否可改未在源码中确认）**。"

